customer: retired_accountant
problem: no_sound
brief:
	Exactly the same issue as his first visit: the only duplicate problem of the week.

== drop-off
(irritated01) Hello again.
+ Back so soon?
	(irritated02) Believe me, I'd rather not be.
+ So, what's your problem?
	(irritated01) It's silent again! Since last night. I didn't touch a thing, I promise.
	+ Really nothing? Not even the volume?
		(thinking) Well... maybe I clicked the little speaker. Once. Or twice.
	- OK, leave it with me. [end]
		(irritated01) Please hurry. The tax office won't wait.

== pick-up
(happy) It plays its little tune again? Wonderful.
